  "body": "### Summary\nAs a maintainer, I want the R50b capture re-anonymized, so that no member name stays in free text of the corpus.\n\n### Scope\n`captures/R50b-search-results-no-cookie.html` holds a member name (not in a member position) in the \"Dernier message correspondant\" search-hit excerpt of one result row; the same text is in the LOT-002 and LOT-005 oracles derived from it (`R50b.oracle.json`, position found by a case-insensitive grep for the name from the operator's list). Its raw capture no longer exists, so it cannot be republished and must not be hand-edited. Re-run the R50b search (cookie-less GET of its URL), add the name to the local `extra_pseudos`, publish, regenerate the oracles, run both `check` modes. The same case was fixed for `R121c` in PR #474.\n\nRefs #474",
